# OpenWrt packages this add-on brings, with their dependencies, from the
# release's own feeds (scripts/addon-upstream.sh): ModemManager with glib,
# libqmi and libmbim, usb-modeswitch and usbmuxd as OpenWrt builds them. The
# kmods come from the target's own kmods for the release's kernel (the
# GL-SFT1200's from its own ImageBuilder), and build-addons.sh refuses them on
# an architecture whose boards run more than one target.
modemmanager
kmod-usb-net-qmi-wwan
kmod-usb-net-cdc-mbim
kmod-usb-serial-option
kmod-usb-net-huawei-cdc-ncm
usb-modeswitch
kmod-usb-net-cdc-ether
kmod-usb-net-cdc-ncm
kmod-usb-net-rndis
kmod-usb-net-ipheth
usbmuxd
